WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:04.910
I'm Jenna Fisher.
我是珍娜·费舍尔。

2
00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:06.310
And I'm Angela Kinsey.
我是安吉拉·金赛。

3
00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:07.890
We were on The Office together.
我们曾一起出演《办公室》。

4
00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:09.150
And we're best friends.
我们还是最好的朋友。

5
00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:13.290
And now we're doing the ultimate Office Lovers podcast just for you.
现在，我们专为你带来终极《办公室》粉丝播客。

6
00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:17.810
Each week, we will dive deeper into the world of The Office with exclusive interviews,
每周，我们都会通过独家采访深入探索《办公室》的世界，

7
00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:20.990
behind-the-scenes details, and lots of BFF stories.
分享幕后细节，还有许多闺蜜间的故事。

8
00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:23.030
We're The Office Lady 6.0.
我们是《办公室》女士 6.0。

9
00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:27.730
Oh, hey there.
噢，嘿。

10
00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:32.850
Are you ready to break down The Office webisodes, The Accountants?
准备好解析《办公室》网络剧《会计师》了吗？

11
00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:34.030
I'm so ready.
我准备好了。

12
00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:35.810
I loved re-watching these.
重温这些剧集太棒了。

13
00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:37.010
It was so fun.
真的很有趣。

14
00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:39.490
I texted Brian Baumgartner this morning.
我今天早上给布莱恩·鲍姆加特纳发了短信。

15
00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:43.590
And I said, Brian, watching these webisodes is making me miss you so much, buddy.
我说，布莱恩，看这些网络剧让我好想你啊，伙计。

16
00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:46.350
We just had such a good time.
我们当时真的玩得很开心。

17
00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:47.710
And of course, Oscar, too.
当然还有奥斯卡。

18
00:00:47.970 --> 00:00:49.950
And the three of us have got to get together.
我们三个人得聚一聚了。

19
00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:51.690
We have our accountant's dinner, you know.
你知道的，我们有会计聚餐。

20
00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:52.350
Yeah.
没错。

21
00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:54.330
So we've got to get it back on the books.
所以我们得把这事儿重新提上日程。

22
00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:58.950
Well, these were written by Paul Lieberstein and Mike Schur.
这些剧集是由保罗·利伯斯坦和迈克·舒尔编写的。

23
00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:01.550
And they were directed by Randall Einhorn.
由兰德尔·艾因霍恩执导。

24
00:01:01.730 --> 00:01:03.470
This was his directorial debut.
这是他的导演处女作。

25
00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:06.730
Yes, it was so exciting.
是的，太令人兴奋了。

26
00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:08.750
I'm going to give you a summary.
我来给你做个总结。

27
00:01:08.990 --> 00:01:09.510
Do it.
请讲。

28
00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:14.890
The accountants discover that there is $3,000 missing from the company money.
会计们发现公司账目少了3000美元。

29
00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:20.970
Everyone is a suspect as they interrogate their co-workers to find the missing funds.
每个人都是嫌疑人，他们审问同事以寻找丢失的资金。

30
00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:24.250
Everyone is on Angela's liSt.
每个人都在安吉拉的名单上。

31
00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:26.190
Well, not everyone.
嗯，也不是每个人。

32
00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:28.730
Well, not Roy or Dwight.
好吧，罗伊和德怀特不在。

33
00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:29.030
Dwight.
德怀特。

34
00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:29.770
There's two.
有两个。

35
00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:30.530
Two missing.
少了两个。

36
00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:32.970
Guess what?
你猜怎么着？

37
00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:35.710
I'm going to give you three fast facts today.
今天我要给你三个速览事实。

38
00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:37.890
It's a rewatch breakdown.
这是重温解析。

39
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:39.010
Excuse me.
不好意思。

40
00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:40.490
I can't get rid of them.
我摆脱不了它们。

41
00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:40.750
Excuse me.
不好意思。

42
00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:42.490
I'm trying so hard.
我真的很努力了。

43
00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:44.450
They will not die.
它们就是挥之不去。

44
00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:47.190
Just lean into the s*** you love, lady.
去拥抱你热爱的东西吧，女士。

45
00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:49.670
All right.
好吧。

46
00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:51.370
Fast fact number one.
速览事实第一条。

47
00:01:52.270 --> 00:02:02.610
The Accountants' webisodes were originally released on July 13, 2016, between Seasons 2 and Seasons 3 on NBC.com.
《会计师》网络剧最初于2006年7月13日在NBC官网发布，介于第二季和第三季之间。

48
00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:07.930
This was their way of keeping office viewers engaged over the summer hiatus.
这是他们在夏季停播期间保持《办公室》观众活跃度的方式。

49
00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:12.370
They were 10 mini-episodes.
它们一共是10集迷你剧。

50
00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:15.370
Each one is about two or three minutes in length.
每一集大约两到三分钟长。

51
00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:21.910
And on July 13, they released the first two on the same day, but then they spaced them out.
7月13日那天，他们同一天发布了前两集，但之后就拉开了发布间隔。

52
00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:22.850
You had to wait.
你得等着。

53
00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:23.430
Oh, yeah.
噢，没错。

54
00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:24.730
To see the next ones.
才能看到接下来的剧集。

55
00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:31.390
You can currently see them on YouTube and also as a special feature on the Season 2 DVD.
你目前可以在YouTube上看到它们，也可以在第二季的DVD特别收录中看到。

56
00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:33.930
Yes, it's disc for everybody.
没错，那是给所有人准备的光盘。

57
00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:36.310
And they're on Peacock as well.
而且Peacock上也有。

58
00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:40.070
Well, The Accountants' was the first series of webisodes.
嗯，《会计师》是第一部网络剧系列。

59
00:02:40.230 --> 00:02:44.090
We end up doing more of these in the future, but these were the firSt.
我们后来又拍了更多这类短片，但这些是最初的几部。

60
00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.610
They were groundbreaking.
它们具有开创性意义。

61
00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:49.910
I'm going to get into that a little more in Fast Fact number three.
我会在第三个冷知识里详细讲讲这个。

62
00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:53.270
But, Angela, we had some fan questions for you.
不过，安吉拉，我们有一些粉丝提问要问你。

63
00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:53.730
Okay.
好的。

64
00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:56.170
The first one is from Amanda G.
第一个问题来自北爱尔兰的阿曼达·G。

65
00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:57.950
in Northern Ireland who said,
她问道：

66
00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.950
How did these episodes come about?
这些剧集是怎么来的？

67
00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:02.690
And we also heard from Bria D.
我们还收到了来自费城的布里亚·D。

68
00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:04.830
in Philly who said,
的提问，她说：

69
00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:09.010
What was your reaction to finding out you guys were going to do these webisodes?
当得知你们要拍这些网络剧时，你的反应是什么？

70
00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:14.210
I remember they reached out to us, and I don't know if they reached out to everyone,
我记得他们联系了我们，我不知道他们是不是联系了所有人，

71
00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:16.810
but I know they reached out to me and Brian and Oscar,
但我知道他们联系了我、布莱恩还有奥斯卡，

72
00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:21.810
and they were talking about doing these little things for NBC.com.
他们当时在商量为NBC.com做这些小短片。

73
00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:25.850
So I remember talking to the folks in the digital department,
我记得当时和数字部门的人聊过，

74
00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:28.650
and they were saying, you know, we think this would be really fun to do.
他们说，你知道的，我们觉得做这个会很有趣。

75
00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:31.170
And I was like, sure, great.
我就说，当然，太棒了。

76
00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:36.870
And I was also very excited to have a bigger storyline with the accountants.
而且我也很兴奋能有更多关于会计师们的剧情线。

77
00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:37.310
Yeah.
没错。

78
00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:41.630
You know, we had our running joke, right, that we would do all these bits in the corner.
你知道，我们有个惯用梗，对吧，就是我们在角落里演各种小段子。

79
00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:43.130
They would never make it in.
但从来没被剪进正片里。

80
00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:47.510
And I know I've talked about this, that we sort of joked that we had a spinoff,
我知道我提过这个，我们当时开玩笑说我们有个衍生剧，

81
00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:51.890
but it was on Telemundo, and Oscar said it was called Los Acantadores.
是在Telemundo频道播的，奥斯卡说剧名叫《会计师们》（Los Acantadores）。

82
00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:53.890
Angela, Oscar, eat a bean.
安吉拉，奥斯卡，吃颗豆子。

83
00:03:53.890 --> 00:04:02.870
I mean, so now here we finally get to have a whole episode, sort of, right, about the accountants.
我是说，现在我们终于能有一整集，算是吧，专门讲会计师们的故事了，对吧？

84
00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:05.730
Okay, are you ready for fast fact number two?
好了，准备好听第二个冷知识了吗？

85
00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:06.730
I am.
准备好了。

86
00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:09.510
This is a fan question from Sarah M.
这是一个来自宾夕法尼亚州萨拉·M。

87
00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:11.530
in Pennsylvania, who said,
的粉丝提问，她说：

88
00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:14.930
were the webisodes filmed on the same day as other episodes,
这些网络剧是和其他剧集在同一天拍摄的吗，

89
00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:18.010
or did the cast come in specifically to film them?
还是演员们专门为了拍它们而来的？

90
00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:21.490
Well, Sarah, guess who I reached out to?
嗯，萨拉，猜猜我联系了谁？

91
00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:25.570
The last from the past, Kentopedia.
来自过去的百科全书，肯特百科（Kentopedia）。

92
00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:29.410
Kentopedia, and then you also reached out to Angelapedia.
肯特百科，然后你还联系了安吉拉百科（Angelapedia）。

93
00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:30.550
I did.
没错。

94
00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:37.130
Let me tell you what I found out, because Kent explained a little bit about how these were produced
让我告诉你我发现了什么，因为肯特从他的角度解释了一些关于这些剧集是如何制作的，

95
00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:41.370
from his point of view, and I'm sure you can confirm a lot of these details, Angela.
我相信你肯定能证实很多细节，安吉拉。

96
00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:44.470
He said, y'all came in on a hiatus week.
他说，你们是在休假周过来的。

97
00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:44.950
Yeah.
没错。

98
00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:46.570
It was in March.
那是在三月份。

99
00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:53.890
It took two days to film all 10 webisodes, and that they were filmed on March 2nd and March 3rd.
拍完所有10集网络剧花了两天时间，是在3月2日和3月3日拍摄的。

100
00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:54.730
Yes.
是的。

101
00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:56.250
And those were our days off.
而那些天正好是我们休息的日子。

102
00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:59.350
So when we came to set that day, there was no one there.
所以当我们定下拍摄那天时，现场一个人都没有。

103
00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:00.750
It was kind of wild.
那种感觉挺奇妙的。

104
00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:05.670
It was like when you go, like, to school, like, after school extracurriculars,
就像你放学后去参加课外活动一样，

105
00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:07.250
and there's, like, no one in the building.
教学楼里空无一人。

106
00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:08.510
Oh, yeah.
噢，没错。

107
00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:11.250
I saw, like, the crew call sheet.
我看到了剧组的通告单。

108
00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.050
Very small crew.
剧组非常精简。

109
00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:18.070
In fact, not only was Randall Einhorn the director of this episode,
事实上，兰德尔·艾因霍恩不仅是这一集的导演，

110
00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:24.230
but he was also the cinematographer and the camera operator, and there was only one camera.
他还是摄影指导和摄像师，而且现场只有一台摄像机。

111
00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:25.010
Is that true?
真的吗？

112
00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:25.810
That's true.
是真的。

113
00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:29.410
Randall did all of that, and then we had one sound person.
兰德尔包揽了所有这些工作，我们当时只有一名收音师。

114
00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:30.590
It was Ben Patrick.
是本·帕特里克。

115
00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:31.890
I saw that, too.
我也看到了。

116
00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:32.210
Yep.
没错。

117
00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:35.610
And they were on stage with us, but that was pretty much it.
他们和我们一起在片场，但基本上就只有这些人了。

118
00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:39.410
Well, here are the actors who were there both days.
那么，这两天都在场的演员有这些。

119
00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:44.490
It was you, Oscar, Brian, Kate, Phyllis, and Leslie.
是你、奥斯卡、布莱恩、凯特、菲利斯和莱斯利。

120
00:05:44.770 --> 00:05:45.130
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

121
00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:51.430
And I really noticed when I was re-watching these how Randall had to get very creative
我在重温这些片段时真的注意到，兰德尔必须非常有创意，

122
00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:56.410
in how he shot things to avoid showing how empty the desks were in the bullpen
他通过调整拍摄方式，避免拍到办公区里空荡荡的工位，

123
00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:58.130
because the whole cast was not there.
因为当时并不是所有演员都在场。

124
00:05:58.310 --> 00:06:02.530
Yes, you're going to see a point of view from the camera that you do not see on the show
是的，你会看到一些平时在每周播出的剧集中看不到的摄像机视角，

125
00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:03.810
that airs every week.
那是每周播出的版本里没有的。

126
00:06:03.810 --> 00:06:05.610
And I loved seeing it.
我非常喜欢看到这些。

127
00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:08.310
I loved seeing this different perspective of the office.
我喜欢看到办公室里这种不同的视角。

128
00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:13.890
I felt like there were so many angles that we did not normally see on the office.
我觉得有很多角度是我们平时在《办公室》里看不到的。

129
00:06:14.090 --> 00:06:14.290
Yeah.
没错。

130
00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:21.410
I got very interested in tracking how Randall was able to shoot things without seeing through
我非常有兴趣去追踪兰德尔是如何在不穿帮的情况下进行拍摄的，

131
00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:22.470
certain windows.
比如避开某些窗户。

132
00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:22.950
Yes.
是的。

133
00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:24.410
Or into the bullpen.
或者避开办公区。

134
00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:31.610
And also, I was tracking how exactly he used Leslie, Kate, and Phyllis in the background
而且，我还在观察他是如何精准地安排莱斯利、凯特和菲利斯作为背景人物的，

135
00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:32.310
of things.
出现在画面中。

136
00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:32.630
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

137
00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:33.490
Strategically.
非常有策略性。

138
00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:34.050
Yes.
没错。

139
00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:38.910
Well, I texted Randall and I said, Randall, I don't know if I ever thanked you for what
我给兰德尔发了条短信，我说，兰德尔，我不知道我是否曾感谢过你，

140
00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:44.090
a wonderful gift it was getting to do these webisodes because it was such a big deal to
能拍摄这些网络剧集是一份多么美妙的礼物，这对我们来说意义重大。

141
00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:44.410
us.
他让拍摄过程变得非常有趣，成片效果也很棒，我真的觉得它们经得起时间的考验。

142
00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:51.190
And he made it so fun and it looks fantastic and I really think they hold up.
好吧，安吉拉，我们这里有一个粉丝问你的问题，是关于拍摄过程的。

143
00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:56.950
Well, we got this fan question for you, Angela, and it's kind of about the process of filming.
来自宾夕法尼亚州阿斯顿的瑞恩·T，他问：安吉拉，你拍摄这个系列最喜欢的部分是什么？

144
00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:58.330
It's from Ryan T.
它和拍摄正剧有什么不同？

145
00:06:58.570 --> 00:07:03.030
in Aston, Pennsylvania, who said, Angela, what was your favorite part
除了剧组人员非常少之外，还有别的吗？

146
00:07:03.030 --> 00:07:07.190
of filming this series and how was it different from filming the actual show?
我只是很喜欢能和奥斯卡、布莱恩一起度过一整天。

147
00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:11.230
I guess maybe besides the very small crew, was there anything else?
我们在一起合作的那几季里，已经编排了许多搞笑的小段子，

148
00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:15.890
I just loved getting to have a whole day with Oscar and Brian.
比如我们那些平时很少有机会展现的会计部互动小剧场。

149
00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:23.490
We had so many silly bits that we had made up already those few seasons together, like
我们当时玩得很开心。

150
00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:28.470
our little accounting dynamics that we would play out that rarely made it to the light
那些互动真的很有趣。

151
00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:28.950
of day.
的一天。

152
